
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>THAOBAN TECH</title>

<style>
:root {
  --bg: #0b1220;
  --panel: #131e30;
  --accent: #45e0c0;
  --white: #ffffff;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--white);
}

header {
  padding: 35px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #102b50, #087f77);
}

header h1 {
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 34px;
}

nav {
  background: var(--panel);
  padding: 15px;
  text-align: center;
}

nav a {
  color: var(--accent);
  text-decoration: none;
  margin: 8px;
  display: inline-block;
}

.hero {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 45px 20px;
}

.hero h2 {
  font-size: 28px;
}

.hero p {
  color: #cbd5e1;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

button {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #0b1220;
  border: none;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.courses {
  padding: 25px 18px;
  text-align: center;
}

.course {
  background: var(--panel);
  padding: 22px;
  margin: 15px auto;
  border-radius: 12px;
  max-width: 450px;
  border: 1px solid #26364d;
}

.course h3 {
  color: var(--accent);
}

.course p {
  color: #cbd5e1;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  background: var(--panel);
  color: #aab8c9;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>⚡ THAOBAN TECH</h1>
  <p>Learn. Build. Program. Innovate.</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#home">Home</a>
  <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
  <a href="#about">About</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <h2>Welcome to THAOBAN TECH</h2>
  <p>
    Explore electronics, robotics, programming
    and embedded systems through practical learning.
  </p>
  <a href="#courses">
    <button>Explore Courses</button>
  </a>
</section>

<section class="courses" id="courses">
  <h2>Our Learning Academy</h2>

  <div class="course">
    <h3>Electronics Fundamentals</h3>
    <p>Understand resistors, LEDs, capacitors,
    transistors and electronic circuits.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="course">
    <h3>Arduino Academy</h3>
    <p>Learn Arduino programming and build
    practical electronics projects.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="course">
    <h3>ESP32 Development</h3>
    <p>Explore microcontrollers, GPIO,
    Wi-Fi and Internet of Things.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="course">
    <h3>Sensors and Measurements</h3>
    <p>Discover ultrasonic, temperature,
    humidity and light sensors.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="course">
    <h3>Robotics Academy</h3>
    <p>Learn motors, automation,
    robotics and control systems.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hero" id="about">
  <h2>About THAOBAN TECH</h2>
  <p>
    Our mission is to make practical technology
    education accessible to everyone.
  </p>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 THAOBAN TECH</p>
  <p>Learn. Build. Innovate.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
